      "effect": "invalid_execution",
      "reason": "The target's initializer calls BaseInit before InitProcess and never creates standalone shared memory. InitProcess therefore encounters the initially null ProcGlobal and raises PANIC. The MyProc assertions provide an additional failure when enabled, but are not needed to establish the blocker.",
